{"title":"Browse tools.simonwillison.net by tag","link":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/11/tools-tags/","date":1794422570000,"content":"\n    \n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/#tags\">Browse tools.simonwillison.net by tag</a></strong></p>\nI've been wanting a better way to browse my <a>collection of vibe-coded tools</a> (244 and counting) for a while. I had a few Fable 5.2 credits left over before my weekly reset so I set it to work using <a href=\"https://github.com/tree-sitter/py-tree-sitter\">tree-sitter</a> to analyze the code for JavaScript APIs, libraries, and web API hosts used by each tool.<p></p>\n<p>The homepage now features tag clouds for browsing by each of those categories of tag:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/#tags\"><img alt=\"Screenshot of two tag cloud sections where tags are sized by count. Browse by JavaScript libraries - Libraries loaded from a CDN by two or more tools. Select a tag to list its tools. @google/generative-ai 3, @jsquash/avif 3, @jsquash/webp 4, Babel 2, Chart.js 2, Cropper.js 2, D3 2, DOMPurify 7, js-yaml 3, JSZip 3, Leaflet 4, markdown-it 4, Marked 12, pako 2, PDF.js 3, Pyodide 11, React 3, Tesseract.js 2, three.js 3. Browse by browser APIs - Web platform features used by each tool's own code. Select a tag to list its tools. &lt;dialog&gt; 5, AbortController 6, Blob URLs 38, BroadcastChannel 1, Built-in AI 1, Camera / microphone 9, Canvas 2D 44, Clipboard API 69, Compression Streams 3, createImageBitmap 2, crypto random values 4, DOMParser 8, Drag and drop 30, Dynamic import() 12, ES modules 92\" src=\"/media/e54c610d415c593ae5b8a7f8a83012404873b226cbc8119cf8f52c4fb3c00e7d.webp\" /></a>\n\n\n    </p><p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/javascript\">javascript</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/tools\">tools</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai\">ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/generative-ai\">generative-ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/llms\">llms</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/claude\">claude</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/vibe-coding\">vibe-coding</a></p>\n\n\n\n","author":"Simon Willison","siteTitle":"Simon Willison’s Weblog","siteHash":"1b599216bd27a00f15d67a3ed9719c64148630c70244b6dd8e743f17cb45527e","entryHash":"975402bcf3b6e6739260f7d3839843fc795fca4f162bea942bd5504ff896d002","category":"Tech"}